                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[H1] Misunderstanding[/h1]\nI had the unpleasantness of playing this game together with my girlfriend (it was not a successful date although she was the one who chose this game). \n\nIn general, the artificial intelligence is a failure, the rules of the game are incomprehensible to me, the animations are atrocious, the readability of the game zero, everything happens randomly and randomly, no skilling. Chaos on the screen, turns into boredom and the feeling that this game has no rules and everything happens randomly, in general it is hard to catch something or play consciously.\n\nI do not recommend, boring,expensive and nasty.",
